+URGENT FIX + UPGRADE MoodPal to full v2 right now:
+
+Current version only draws two pink circles → replace the entire canvas code with a COMPLETE chibi generator that works perfectly.
+
+Must include:
+• Full cute chibi character (big expressive eyes, round head, tiny body, hair, accessories)
+• Mood-based style & colors (examples: love → heart eyes + pink neon, chaos → swirl eyes + yellow sparks, sad → teary eyes + blue aura, angry → fire eyes + red, etc.)
+• Automatic eye-blink animation every 3–4 seconds
+• 100 % transparent background
+• Works with ANY language (English, French, Spanish, Japanese, emojis…)
+
+Add these features:
+1. Daily streak counter “Day 12” (using localStorage)
+2. Streak badges drawn on the chibi:
+   - 3 days → tiny golden crown
+   - 7 days → angel wings
+   - 30 days → legendary halo + “Eternal Pal” text
+3. Small 365-day contribution calendar below (green squares for active days)
+4. Auto-detect browser language and translate placeholder + buttons (support at least English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Turkish, Arabic)
+5. Three buttons after generation:
+   • Download as PFP (transparent PNG – must work)
+   • Cast on Farcaster (auto-fill “Day 12 – Feeling [mood] #MoodPal” + image)
+   • Gift a MoodPal (prompt for wallet address → simu “sent!”)
+
+Use only HTML + vanilla JavaScript + canvas. No external libraries, no wallet connect yet.
+
+Deploy the fixed and upgraded version immediately.

